🐧 Complete Linux Interview Guide — How to Answer & Clear the Interview
Covers: Fresher → Mid-Level → Senior/Expert Questions with Model Answers + Interview Tips

🎯 Interview Strategy First
Before diving into questions, follow this STAR Formula for every technical answer:

